claim.claim-text:
a wireless interface configured for receiving a multicast signal for the at least one cell, the multicast signal containing a deduction from a content (604);
wherein the apparatus is configured for evaluating a channel quality level of a channel quality between the apparatus and a transmitter of the multicast signal and for deriving a connectivity information indicating the channel quality;
wherein the apparatus is configured for transmitting a feedback signal containing the connectivity information using a resource element of the wireless communication network, the resource element being one of a set of resource elements associated with reporting connectivity information; wherein each resource element of the set of resource elements is associated with a channel quality level;
wherein the apparatus is configured for transmitting the feedback signal using a resource element associated with a channel quality level lower when compared to the determined channel quality level; or
wherein the apparatus is configured for transmitting the feedback signal using a resource element associated with the channel quality level being the determined channel quality level.

a data memory having stored thereon a key;
a wireless interface configured for receiving a multicast signal (612) for the at least one cell, the multicast signal (612) containing a deduction from a content (604);
a control unit;
wherein the apparatus is configured for synchronizing to the wireless network and to receive the multicast signal whilst remaining unassociated with the wireless network;
wherein the apparatus is configured for decoding the deduction using the control unit and the key.

receiving a multicast signal (612) for the at least one cell with a wireless interface, the multicast signal containing a deduction from a content (604);
evaluating a channel quality level of a channel quality between the apparatus and a transmitter of the multicast signal and for deriving a connectivity information indicating the channel quality;
transmitting a feedback signal containing the connectivity information using a resource element of the wireless communication network, the resource element being one of a set of resource elements (RB<1>-RB<5>) associated with reporting connectivity information; wherein each resource element of the set of resource elements is associated with a channel quality level;
transmitting the feedback signal using a resource element associated with a channel quality level lower when compared to the determined channel quality level; or
transmitting the feedback signal using a resource element associated with the channel quality level being the determined channel quality level.

reading a key from a data memory;
receiving a multicast signal (612) for the at least one cell using a wireless interface, the multicast signal (612) containing a deduction from a content (604);
synchronizing to the wireless network and to receive the multicast signal whilst remaining unassociated with the wireless network; and
decoding the deduction using the control unit and the key.
